## Install process

Build the Docker containers and run them

```
docker-compose build

docker-compose up -d
```

Create the database and run the migrations

```
docker-compose exec app php bin/console doctrine:database:create

docker-compose exec app php bin/console make:migration:migrate
```

### Possible issues

If you have issues with the SSL certificate locally

Copy the cert from the frankenphp container :

```
docker compose cp app:/data/caddy/pki/authorities/local/root.crt ./caddy_root_ca.crt
```

Copy the cert into the known ssl certificates on the local machine

```
sudo cp ./caddy_root_ca.crt /usr/local/share/ca-certificates/caddy_root_ca.crt
sudo update-ca-certificates
```

